IBG France – Connectivity Questions for France IT Team

1. Runtime Machine Details

Confirm the basic information about the runtime machines.
	•	What are the hostnames / IP addresses of the runtime machines?
	•	Are the runtime machines domain joined?
	•	Which Windows version is installed?
	•	How many runtime machines will be provided?

⸻

2. PAM to Runtime Machine Access

Since access is through PAM → Dameware → Runtime Machine, confirm:
	•	Is Dameware already installed on the runtime machines?
	•	Which version of Dameware is used?
	•	What ports are required for Dameware connection?
	•	Should PAM IP addresses be whitelisted in the France firewall?

Example question:
	•	Please confirm the source IP range of PAM that should be allowed to access the runtime machines.

⸻

3. Firewall Configuration

Ask France IT to confirm firewall rules.
	•	What ports must be opened from PAM servers → runtime machines?
	•	Are there any network security restrictions?
	•	Is there any jump server required before accessing runtime machines?

⸻

4. Runtime Machine Software Requirements

Confirm which software must be installed on the runtime machines.

Typical requirements:
	•	Blue Prism Runtime Resource
	•	Required application clients
	•	Browser (Chrome / Edge)
	•	.NET Framework
	•	Any banking application required for IBG process

Questions:
	•	Will France IT install all required software, or should the automation team install it?

⸻

5. Connectivity from Runtime Machine to Blue Prism

Confirm how runtime machines connect internally.
	•	What is the Blue Prism Application Server Load Balancer URL?
	•	What is the Hub Load Balancer URL?
	•	Which port is used for Blue Prism connection (typically 8199)?
	•	Is HTTPS required?

⸻

6. Access Credentials

Security access clarification.
	•	Will service accounts be provided for the runtime machines?
	•	Will operators log in using domain accounts through PAM?
	•	Are there password vault or credential management policies?

⸻

7. Security Policies

Important for banking environments.
	•	Are there endpoint protection tools installed (EDR / antivirus)?
	•	Are there restrictions on installing automation tools?
	•	Is USB or file transfer restricted?

⸻

8. Monitoring and Logging

Ask how runtime activity is monitored.
	•	Are runtime machines integrated with SIEM or monitoring tools?
	•	Should automation logs be stored locally or centrally?